  "description": "IronWord allows developers to load, generate, edit and save DOCX files in .NET Applications  & websites.\n\nAn easy and intuitive library to work with DOCX files in C#.\n\nFor code samples, docs & more visit https://ironsoftware.com/csharp/word/\n\nDoes not require Office Interop. Works well with .NET Framework, .NET Core and Azure. All without extra dependencies or the need to install MS Office.\n\nIronWord works well in C#, VB.NET, MVC, ASP.NET projects for Websites, Console & Desktop apps.\n\nWorks with:\n- .NET Core 2 , 3.1\n- .NET 5\n- .NET 6\n- .NET 7\n- .NET 8\n- .NET 9\n- .NET 10\n- .NET Standard 2  & 3\n- .NET Framework 4.7.2 and above\n- Xamarin, SharePoint, Mono\n- Azure, AWS, Cloud hosting\n- Windows, Linux, macOS, Mobile\n\nLicensing  & Support available for commercial deployments.\n\nFind full documentation at: https://ironsoftware.com/csharp/word/\n\nFor support please contact us: support@ironsoftware.com",
